{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/jasmine-damac-properties-damac-hills","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":316,"crm_id":"2339","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Jasmine","slug":"jasmine-damac-properties-damac-hills","display_address":"Damac Hills","building_type":["apartment","townhouse"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Damac Properties","price":2047000,"display_price":"2.047M","lattitude":25.0125322,"longitude":55.2473379,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Jasmine is a luxury residential development in DAMAC Hills consisting of two buildings Jasmine A and Jasmine B, as well as townhouses. Apartments range from <strong>studios to 3-bedroom residences</strong>, <strong>townhouses are mostly 3-4 bedrooms.</strong> The interior finishes are in neutral colours and the apartments are furnished and equipped with appliances. All units have panoramic glazing and balconies that offer beautiful views of the local natural attractions and golf course.</p><p>Inside the residences and on the territory of the complex there is everything necessary for a comfortable life: lifts, ventilation, air conditioning, water supply, video surveillance, swimming pool, SPA - centres, fitness rooms, car parks, catering establishments, retail outlets, pharmacies and other elements of the internal infrastructure.</p><p>Jasmine residential complex is surrounded by picturesque green landscapes, among gardens and parks belonging to the Akoya Oxygen themed area. The community popularises a quiet, measured life in unity with nature.</p><p>CreaKids daycare centre is located close to the complex. Jebel Ali School is a 7-minute walk away and South View School is 9 minutes by car. The nearest medical centre, Mediclinic Parkview Hospital, is a 15-minute drive away. Convenient road links allow for easy access by own or public transport. The nearest bus stop Mudon Al Salam Town Centre is an 8 minute walk away, Umm Al Sheif Metro Station is 15 minutes away and the International Airport is 30 minutes by car.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2339/images/2024/06/26/yrVSOK1MLKymQ3eAIup1kGQ18FEyXNYRhoWIuPmY.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/26/yrVSOK1MLKymQ3eAIup1kGQ18FEyXNYRhoWIuPmY.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2339/images/2024/06/26/xwIm5OLfrLPKqQGgaf1gT6L1mfyHd3foazRSMZYp.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/26/xwIm5OLfrLPKqQGgaf1gT6L1mfyHd3foazRSMZYp.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2339/images/2024/06/26/QR90kW0KKUvDV0mmk2c4ACsAiUCbKmoTE5P6TW6g.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/26/QR90kW0KKUvDV0mmk2c4ACsAiUCbKmoTE5P6TW6g.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2345,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1583,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1744,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1745,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 bedroom Townhouse","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1746,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"4 Bedroom Townhouse","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1747,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"Studio","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"100%","payment_plans":[{"id":7346,